general_details.Description:
The  course is organized around five parts: 

1) Entrepreneurs and ideas: the basis of small business; 

2) Small business paths and plans; 

3) Marketing in the small business; 

4) Cash, Accounting, Finance in the small business; 

5) Management and Organization in the small business. 

Particular emphasis will be placed on internal, external business analyis, business strategies, business plans, marketing plans, asset management, and human resource management. 

Vigorous class discussions, cases, activities, along with group projects and self quizzes will provide the basis for the learning environment in the classroom.

